{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "batch": 1511,
  "batch_count": 1652,
  "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
  "source_commit": "33cae8524551c593c4a9016580345724140f0481",
  "source_language": "zh-CN",
  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ba889078d19c7278fe79dd20",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我的喜好一直没变哦。\n还是很喜欢可爱的衣服！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8d8fb58c87d3ae61742365ea12f750b9de7648a6be86773441f8374e3da05f52",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1114",
        "70021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1d1ae67d2c0db9f465434db2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这套制服是努力的证明。\n就和你的徽章一样呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5189287b9070b4709de05ecedf2d4f1874f95bbca54807554ac954953dd28340",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1114",
        "71004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8175b0087f84e09c0d9f16c8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "即便在Live上，\n也想让大家看到绝景！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3226896045fd3fcfb044a46447a4115b9d46091b681ab39b3819ee27106827b6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1114",
        "71008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7eae5550d190b711b6e22d5b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "就用这套决胜服，\n来实现我们的梦想！",
      "source_fingerprint": "83af9d3798d1020b1235858d47f6067ee54cad1a1907b31d92d8317f5b71b687",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1114",
        "71009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7daf9c317edb2afaf839ed8f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "能一起来到特雷森学园，\n真的像做梦一样！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1c3fb99c2007f3d5efd61e6b0ba2b63a4d94381cb3e6f64559ea607ef68351ac",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1114",
        "71010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:900e9315cde8e84af46a56eb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "即使穿着和大家一样的衣服，\n你也能马上找到我吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2d557c66d7af6f7d686f844477a9aa8ff5f1ac8fd15d92e7b7bd1b4fc4d42ea6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1114",
        "71014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a9a6f931fa357024c269cd46",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "衣服上的腰带，\n一紧张就会忍不住去抓呢……",
      "source_fingerprint": "d1dbb2b16ef5a1831eda04386b584331cfaa29b896435db938d8b6e98cb53652",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1114",
        "71015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8472fc51162a78827be9d3ea",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哇，好漂亮的衣服！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4cb28125eddaa1960041d122e354ffd7515aee6e714ecd7f2a4c934bac809d81",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1114",
        "71018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7320e71dc71fade09e8d5271",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "怎么样？\n……有变得和平常不一样吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "873f581e62d58bf071c02f0ad35d2d66e9883ebd280c11fb9e32c5860a2bc6a0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1114",
        "71019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c2a6203c99a567ed9e96b4dd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "辛苦了",
      "source_fingerprint": "bd96bf364b8b21a3bb94efcf4ef82feb1bc34cf02203524e7949dbd19151dd13",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1114",
        "80000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:58560b681cb682a12cc39157",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "欸嘿嘿……这样真好。\n每天早上都能和你见面打招呼。",
      "source_fingerprint": "76dd768ec14fa3a25ab421a5996bbed9e0043764816c51492af7c22e4373ecd6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1114",
        "90000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9e91e4046281ea07271a799d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "早上好……哥哥……\n啊……不对！训练员！\n…………真是的，别笑了啦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8fb0748d059a0ebe730dd48c4bda881989a030be5426e431a258a0627e9a05fd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1114",
        "90001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:11a734292bc9377059c1709a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "明天有一场便当交换会。\n不知不觉参加者越来越多了……\n就像野餐一样好期待啊♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "7588061b0ddcd13194eaeec5ba6745e58ca5b5c2fa656fb491d9b0beb68293b3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1114",
        "90002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:556a62ecc1e117a0b94425ca",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "创升同学和小潘多拉\n想要不容易长蛀虫的点心\n……嗯~要不下次做做看吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "e095c945ff1ae58ca2c78cc218d6240d1363cb5e3ca7a08864e355568d34dbc3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1114",
        "90003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8cf9bf5df12a957aad11bc45",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今晚的电视剧会是什么走向呢？\n那位青梅竹马，绝对会哭的……\n好想去见见她抱抱她。",
      "source_fingerprint": "172af9fd280cc6d8d79023975f593209e2ef9b242d801448a162f1b9a1c82ed5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1114",
        "90004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:679f1d855b3540211bfd5d15",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "洗完澡后会和宿舍里的大家聊天。\n从琐事到烦恼咨询……\n听大家聊各种事很让人开心。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9e91e88f3791e4fbf410d9f54a39a280c27295a4e551bb18f75a0d37a5dc4cf0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1114",
        "90005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2f958dda26aecefb396c15ce",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "家门口的樱花好像开了。\n妈妈说要我们一起去看看。\n……要去一下吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "24baa44e7674f8fd811b2375e4039381e5f423ad7aefc3fca8bd4c62048b4944",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1114",
        "90006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:928a1900b9d94ae52766aa23",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "刚才碰到有位同学忘了带防晒，\n就把我的借给她了。\n要是被晒伤可就不好了。\n",
      "source_fingerprint": "6a560dfa0ebbd0e85e8e404bf1be72bacdfd960a18af694136e24fa79c1afaa7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1114",
        "90007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f9c58131d3c316c69b08e843",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "刚才发现了一片很大的落叶。\n和你的手差不多大……\n真的哦！等下就给你拿过来！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a67df2a128508d9ff6397538f05774f6723e190fe6cf0bc94f4350f5055d89dc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1114",
        "90008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3782179c4e8948fb9bd8bcbc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "最近小潘多拉总是喜欢\n握着我的手呢。\n说这样能当暖宝宝用……呵呵。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3be27d3119f86de16acbb8ce8571e7e114299d34b44b6146767945264b17634e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1114",
        "90009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d56fbd2ed329f63c8bf09974",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "情人节快乐♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "84545e9d062a703e60cf0240a4c6690b3f86c69931c0b8d072086c92aed0b29d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1114",
        "90020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d159ce04ae79d7edbac20b6c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "早上好……姐姐……\n啊……不对！训练员！\n…………真是的，别笑了啦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0ee38233aa17f40d5c04fd9cb1ee0548da63bc7dbbf98114cd6e84ec599ccd27",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1114",
        "90101"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bb712eb98f60e79b834ce651",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "小特前辈和小西沙里奥的话，\n蕾丝缎带应该很适合她们吧……\n送出去的话，她们会戴吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "b3c23e13dbd67d317b8836a30a7b27188fefb1c7fa84bc921af9807babdb496c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1114",
        "91000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0a679cec83a3811a62059a08",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "又时髦，又能带动气氛……\n佐敦同学，我有些憧憬她呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4f3cb56c4a9b7e4af3dae2cd940cb9ec144042e9c67864292f92495736549382",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1114",
        "91001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:31b63390cbebc73a99e21633",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "在巷子里迷路时中山同学帮了我。\n还说“这不是你该来的地方”……\n这是什么意思呢？",
      "source_fingerprint": "fb53059edcf3f38b86105a74961dbd5b05811fcdfce22f4228ca3981d1003649",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1114",
        "91002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:950352a686d2b8cb7251f469",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "最近，和贵妇人同学一起\n做了面向运动员的甜点呢。\n要来尝尝看吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "2c0e054cc4a8760e315af59473d98bde7a7b890a04cd1f4d06035536d364ca94",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1114",
        "91003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:84dc65d2d7e78b9046d9c309",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "创升同学什么都知道呢。\n我小时候的事，还有我自己\n没注意到的习惯她都……好厉害啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ca350c0038977efb09067007181b46e5c1ea4a36f43b88554d1333b95ab366d7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1114",
        "91004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:71d1ae10735922ffae87e4b7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这套衣服我好喜欢啊~\n因为和大家同款，\nLive时会很有一体感呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8e5b9bec40d80fa7bb6299ad59f568050f83a439d62438f5a75e7802627a6488",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1114",
        "91005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e7a844a936f4be8532241a50",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "Live结尾说谢幕词的时候，\n虽然会想着得忍住不哭……\n不过……还是会忍不住。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b2934a045d99afed41561371c76978cd052add685a64318a8c5aa5a7330358c3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1114",
        "91006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4ae110d6d401e563c44b9bf6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "一直都很憧憬小特前辈的决胜服……\n所以才想把我的也设计成那种\n可爱的样式呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9b4b4abf705a630ac69647b36156e856124f9e97606dbf5d611f2c0c1a5a6419",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1114",
        "91007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4c5144fe42eb934de2fa8714",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你送的胸针，我会带去参赛的。\n……这可是一直支持着我的\n重要宝物。",
      "source_fingerprint": "db0523b06032b8f96dc79b4ca96671b0be30f044c46575f1f600ad48d0445a2c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1114",
        "91008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:af63a1a4957fc3078071c517",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "宿舍食堂每天早上都热闹非凡，\n我偶尔会去搭把手。\n要是有稍微帮上忙就好了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3c3baa31062fcb82e01645cda92d1ae7d4ac4fd20246a516498c98e7fb99e2b0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1114",
        "91009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c1b5de16898962d205e8c849",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "梦之旅同学和巨匠同学，\n总是会在一起开心地喝茶呢。\n我是独生女所以有些羡慕她们。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0918517da18ac2a8fe8d5aad7490ebd12809a8bde26e912f19aaa7e2abc1e425",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1114",
        "91010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:18734ea67e531d876ffeee1b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "锐骏同学送了我荞麦枕。\n沙沙的声音和香香的气味\n让人实在难以抵抗……♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "931c556a61e6f6f72843a3e052eab5ac4445546a5d078ee5d52d8ffd544426ed",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1114",
        "91011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f44d4bf176b3c13449ad50fb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "刚才给迷路新生带了路……\n太懂那种感觉了。\n刚入学时我也天天迷路呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a9e071e0dfee78d88aed9fefc82a0ba8a0951b492df20c93197a5c330ec5ac29",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1114",
        "91012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:337c4a1a64abe33c399f8032",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "向日葵花田，好想再去一次啊。\n虽然没法像以前那样撒开腿跑……\n但能一起静静欣赏也会很开心哦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "004cb97d10fdc92075752a2265ba79ee1a5c3b4a182f8a556425938367fd588c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1114",
        "91013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ba1f937cf3d5809dc0eaf847",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "落叶拼贴……不对，应该叫\n圣女之印？和小梦一起做了这个！\n这可是自信之作哦♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "5317ae8bd1518873a710bbc6af6640076d403aa32db644c493f9064ed8e152ab",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1114",
        "91014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c3111c2c3ace95e535e6701e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今天的路面很漂亮吧？\n和志愿者伙伴还有勤务师傅们\n一起仔细扫过雪了呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e7e2d916864c7d48932e06635005c35eebcf52181dcff8fa8a79161bd58c4ae5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1114",
        "91015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6017b731c5799c53df3972f1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要用你率直的双眼……\n好好看着比以前更快的我哦，\n训练员！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a59c54100c67dff26ab5c159b91e01913f02285d79b69a0af09a2f69ef3cfd02",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1114",
        "92000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7e511f387f811aa271f8531f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "久等了！抱歉，刚才有位同学在找\n陪练对象……现在帮完忙了，\n可以开始了哦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "265ea1aac501009aa21ca7af48940f40f316692893003959246cfe2c64576596",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1114",
        "92001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2463a91adf4f817e98fb4ca4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我已经不是那个爱撒娇的小景了。\n严格一点，彻底锻炼我一番吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "384f1cbbd7c5d4de07a4eedcd6884657b38045962dc5371e1d87dc05da7ad888",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1114",
        "92002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ed519eafd797765dc5ece8cc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "那位同学每天都这样好厉害的。\n从早到晚只为了自己的梦想……\n肯定……不，绝对会实现的……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "fc712063107242dd60502014338f1d138fbdeeccd7b239531da0f434f71ddb7e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1114",
        "92003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ff29db5157454167c8169dfe",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "因为有那天交换过的约定，\n因为我们一步步走到今天——\n才得以看见眼前的景色呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "86a2bdbdc702a478f8f4a13e2eb7535158240a7c898b5abcf2dc52e866653e5f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1114",
        "92005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e5d1f98e49ae7986c03df38d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "再次意识到。所谓“绝景”，\n只有我的话无法抵达……\n是因为和哥哥一起才得以看见。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ffed287a37461ba8e7757cbc6132a546db10478dd05d566664be15030ba10a60",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1114",
        "92006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:626eda701e8a173dfe02d196",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我会为你展现无法忘怀，\n世界第一的美丽景色。\n……约好了哦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "81ae3b2ff8b6f4edc5cbeb5ba044c8d1cca2fe32ae6072c8a0d48e6a2618f240",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1114",
        "92007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:131990a37582a928ba94e3d1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "集中，集中，集训中！\n呜~……大家看起来那么开心，\n注意力都要被带跑了……",
      "source_fingerprint": "25b7d51e62260e847eda208e7fd68dea36c5b34e33a216cc8735dde95bc64d8d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1114",
        "92011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ddebc2d723eb26788a433641",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "再次意识到。所谓“绝景”，\n只有我的话无法抵达……\n是因为和姐姐一起才得以看见。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f2e32e0d80c3953edff8a1d71f054ac52d49dfd2f5ea9038a7c902e0f554cb9c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1114",
        "92106"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6ed7ec765612c5108424a5c9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这片“绝景”，\n一直以来都想和你共赏……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "bec783862ec8cda50f03460cec6fb04af7e79008cb1e7614a5999eff751900bc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1114",
        "93000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:28396d9e32e7d2fb74aed090",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "是那天的约定，\n为我带来了力量哦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "bd0e6c4d90cb1456993a97d03fe473e6dd16a1b1b45968acdec4caa8144d1a74",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1114",
        "93001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8c486ad3f680ac99c4e58d1b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "为了我们的梦想……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "51ec9e09ec68c617c695c59d59b6619c87adb779dd28040c85b4dafbdfe4aedc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1114",
        "95000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fa3b0957315b6a7553b32575",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "欸嘿嘿，我也有所成长了对吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "cefbd2045a76de4d91ca67aaaaddfbaefa5d5b62d65c040a4e3552ccc39d8b40",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1114",
        "95001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1d04d7fb0c74c5dc4f46e4b8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我是迷人景致。\n……有点痒痒的呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3dd7283194453aec9c640fefb720bce0c12cf2131d71d3e8bbcf221a7ee5341a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1114",
        "95003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:23af9760bd7729ebe3703324",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "那天梦想的“绝景”——\n总有一天一定能抵达！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b21099fef8ff57e46c98a1b6ce06152b5c9c9ea5834af20f43c3b0e7003cf94a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1114",
        "95004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e230f46fc0cbbca918342f17",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "没事吧？要帮忙吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "44636995391df15d9bcf2dcedf7b6daf1eca49b224f499123a25e99febe495c0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1114",
        "95005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:038724104c484eb54d3aaceb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "多依靠我一点。好吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "487da41fcda573e2ed2e6ec8793872d584dd45317a3643d53aabdd9fd14f4ebc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1114",
        "95006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1d60fb5291b526927f6bde74",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "どれ、王が見てやる。",
      "source_fingerprint": "edf55a2dde60645ffd5fd75778428f7c19f536095ce85e920700402c4a7cd541",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1115",
        "20051"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e238339bc188731b8417539c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我が覇道、そこで[rub:はい]拝[/rub]するがいい。",
      "source_fingerprint": "fcc2384e682ba7f6e6132f5bcd6ef2bb6d2eabe2f4b866d4e2352f09e42eda70",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1115",
        "70000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:92fe1d5cc21991cfc1d078c6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "力は貸そう、存分に励め。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8ffc942790f0f9532a2c63c20a8fd516088d4481f896fe363af1ebe28e92a640",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1115",
        "95005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:abb7d6991021383d74708b33",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "この力、活用せねば許さんぞ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "701dac18c62a7c8bf51ac689a4b04da1136147373b0e8fd570c311b9bdaff7fe",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1115",
        "95006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2c6ec3caa63aee14eb250b73",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "まいりましょう。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7649606ba64bd115f061bcad811531899eef88e8676bafd30764edc12fa46186",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1116",
        "1000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:483ca2da47c4b290b7dab60c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "誘い文句は半人前なのに、\r\n躍起になって提案するんだもの。\r\nつい、耳を傾けてしまいましたわ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "80e170b1e5cae547e27e12c1d68c16ff68a740fca2274111eb26247ed23315a2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1116",
        "10000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:76f0e9ee05459e9cdd456247",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "行ってくるわ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4e42824481b89139758cebcbc6de379bc2bfe391af6bc5931ce02cac1bdb2432",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1116",
        "100000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:38fbf3d7790b5a652d6f7b82",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "帰ったわよ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ddc186128a672a7409aec0a1276e0d2cfb4143630f7dcc95b07e37764916e581",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1116",
        "100001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fdf81ffb29f1383dbbd2f18c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "貴方の示す道標、\r\nなかなか興味深くてよ。\r\nさ、次は何を見せてくださるの？",
      "source_fingerprint": "204b17c6cf0df6c6323b58cb1ac406310fc1c7627d531fc7f920d505dcada37e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1116",
        "10001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9e0e59073b60eecc912e5966",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "あれからも力を求め、日々\r\n精進しているとお見受けしますわ。\r\n…殊勝なのね。よろしいじゃない。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0980b7b82076d05898abebfd578da82d1abda826180b9bced2a448fc259e6947",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1116",
        "10002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:50e0186974449f4d8163a031",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "年が明けても、心持ちは変わらない\r\n求めるは最強、欲するは勝利のみよ",
      "source_fingerprint": "b870dc57c657f6644f28e54cff5264edffe597a241ddc4fc64b1977eb4bd2931",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1116",
        "10003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d27f22581a665fe316fe45c9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "チョコレート？ああ、\r\n使用人に見繕わせましたわ。\r\n後ほどお受け取りくださいませ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8f9e652993295b7a1c50dc7b0700174ee1cf5a0faa82977716c20b1d587d0798",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1116",
        "10004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3608b0b3d70c40621f49a307",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今日は、贔屓にしている\r\nショコラティエが来日していますの\r\nさあ、連れて行ってくださる？",
      "source_fingerprint": "fbf2a9483f8558f92a74b9c5d45d5e9baf5a7e0b8e95b869564de9fa5babff15",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1116",
        "10005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3f3cdccbc25575f0d623ab3c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "大望にも揺るがぬ、頑健な\r\n『キョチク』を取り寄せましたわ。\r\n天に願いを、突き刺しましょう。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2dadf2aa75a523b0d5f9a5b78930d2359b6172554fd5df64120988bd08ddde80",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1116",
        "10006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8f8e5d6dfd84001200d69788",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "鎮魂の折、我が家を繁栄させた\r\n祖に掲げましょう。家督となり、\r\n私が最盛をもたらします――と。",
      "source_fingerprint": "81016f5cfceb3be46fa50ffaef8b9df91211ce443f0ec68802e62d3cd465ed9d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1116",
        "10007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6f4fb036dc6ad844599c2fbf",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "屋敷で開かれる聖夜のディナーは、\r\n客人をもてなす習わし。貴方を\r\n招く日が来るかは、精励次第ね。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8c571b947c29d40284dc84ac74517a374e8d7bf7fd35c027cff351b2fe662f55",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1116",
        "10008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:82b6e0d19d113c033a47f834",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "日頃から愉快な企みをする\r\n貴方ですもの。クリスマスも、\r\n満足させてくださるわよね？",
      "source_fingerprint": "8b0222b8744074ed54f05960ef43925b91b9c219b66d499575124c1e4bae0775",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1116",
        "10009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b73e0efa8deaff2c303f511c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "当然ですわ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "58346bb01a172728d7a406de1f09eb528619935dc6babef727d7a6627f2c7c09",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1116",
        "1001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5abc908be8753a4692ec67f6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "年末は家門の集まりがあるのよ。\r\n展望を語り、雄弁をふるう一夜…\r\nほほほ、今年も熱くなりそう！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4d9e70018d4ee782ce212ac84ebcad9fd00e4672adecdbdba5a04a5a2b83cde8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1116",
        "10010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bb885225e6ac5694a0d3c8ca",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "お誕生日おめでとうございます。\r\n今日は休暇を取るといいわ。\r\nまた私に、献身できるように。",
      "source_fingerprint": "eabd640f2e6c67bce0650511661cd01f1f2f4f7639f045023761f7c23e4637da",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1116",
        "10011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:489ae18cc8ca32301de9f88d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "カシミヤ生地で、貴方のスーツを\r\n仕立てましょう。柔い着心地に、\r\n包み込まれるといいわ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "019a5ffae637fcf45cbc4a50f2b26ed2dfa0d212946cb4a30643e244e611c985",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1116",
        "10012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:076b037d9bb776612933a223",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "あら、お祝い感謝いたしますわ。\r\n返礼は、私が勝利をさらう姿を\r\n特等席で…というのはいかが？",
      "source_fingerprint": "b642ff57af23dbbfe7f58421e0c577c91eb91ec118913a6f03cd3bebb30d06b8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1116",
        "10013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f59a3b8c2ee7318a83b30729",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "これまでのどの誕生日祝いより、\r\nもてなしてくれますわよね？\r\nふふふっ…楽しみね。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d837f1815627923b51585dc4135dd15c5158d9c3d61d087e24f5a552a5092689",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1116",
        "10014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:92ae929d4685c83a15db8767",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "お知らせが来ているわ。\r\n果たし状でもまじっていれば、\r\n退屈しのぎになるのだけれど。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e6c393de0d73a098cb354e8506d9393066e149042ece849773764d719cd50539",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1116",
        "10015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1b745f63f8924523a3c0cd70",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "贈答品が届いていますわ。\r\n鬼が出るか蛇が出るか…。\r\nおほほ、冗談ですわ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a7d0c110cf142c67d94bf935794d355e3de1c4db793fd5bda46c22acd9ad2f66",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1116",
        "10016"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
